### Create House 1 (deve dar 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/houses
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "House 1",
  "locationId": 5,
  "areaSqMt": 100.0,
  "pricePerNight": 50.0,
  "description": "A nice house"
}

