### Create House - locationId não é LOCALITY (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/houses
Authorization: Bearer {{myToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid House",
  "locationId": 1,
  "areaSqMt": 100.0,
  "pricePerNight": 50.0,
  "description": "Location is a COUNTRY, not a LOCALITY"
}

### Create House (Missing Token) (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/houses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "House 1",
  "locationId": 5,
  "areaSqMt": 100.0,
  "pricePerNight": 50.0,
  "description": "A nice house",
  "ownerId": 1
}

### Get House 1 por id
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/1

### Get House 2 por id
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/2

### Get House - id inexistente (deve dar 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/999

### Get House - id inválido (deve dar 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/houses/abc

### Get All Houses
GET http://localhost:8080/houses